</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, October 25, 2004 - 9:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->YES TOM, I AM CURIOUS AS TO THE REASON THE GRID KEEPS GETTING BIGGER AND BIGGER.  WHATSMORE I AM CURIOUS AS TO WHY YOU HAVE TURNED IT INTO A CROSS WORD PUZZLE.  EVEN IF YOU GET THE WORDS YOU NEED OUT OF IT WHAT IMPORTANCE DOES IT HAVE?  AND ON A SIDE NOTE LINE 6 WOULD ALSO SPELL OUT NEW, SCRAMBLED UP LIKE THE BTK LINE....MIGHT THIS MEAN NEW BTK, SINCE THESE ARE THE ONLY TWO NOT SPELLED OUT CORRECTLY?  YOUR FEEDBACK ON THIS TOPIC IS GREATLY APPRECIATED. <BR> <BR>SCRATCHING HIS HEAD <BR>WICHITAN<!--/Text--></td></tr>
