</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, October 27, 2004 - 9:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I see your reasoning, and appreciate your clarification in this matter.  I only wanted to inderstand your concept more thourghly.  But again this is the only website, to which I have seen this grid.  Whatsmore is it the key to figuring out the other 3 grids we know he sent?  If so Sean get to crackin, you seem to be the man for the job!...LOL. <BR> <BR>thanks again, <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
