<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1325"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Oliver<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Oliver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, October 31, 2004 - 8:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The grid seems to suggest that BTK was connected in some way with the DMV. Even if he was just a maintenance man there, he would have had access to making false ids, etc.. Also, the grid seems to say that BTK New &#40;knew&#41; Nancy Fox. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
