<!--Post: 1334--><!--Time: 1099360677-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1334"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, November 01, 2004 - 5:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I thought it meant  <BR> <BR>btk clu dmv new fox <BR> <BR>Which can be rearanged several ways. <BR> <BR>New BTK clu&#40;e&#41; fox dmv <BR>Or maybe phonetically it means fox&#40;K&#41;new btk&#34; <BR> <BR>Interesting anyway. <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
