<!--Post: 1338--><!--Time: 1099414187-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1338"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, November 02, 2004 - 8:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t really know.  I am going by the little available info.  I haven&#39;t seen anything other that whatTom posted, so it&#39;s hard to say. <BR>It is interesting though! <BR> <BR>At the very least DMV figures somehow with Fox?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
